      "title": "Tens of thousands protest against Narendra Modi regime in Delhi",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/01/india-opposition-protest-rally-delhi",
      "description": "<p>Led by Congress party, India’s opposition alliance channels anger over removal of 130 million names from voter roll</p><p>Thousands of opposition supporters have gathered in Delhi as protests against the Narendra Modi government continue to gather momentum.</p><p>Led by the Congress party, India’s opposition alliance has brought together supporters from across the country, amid <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/11/cockroach-party-leader-released-delhi-protests-second-day\">growing anger</a> over a large-scale revision of the country’s voter roll that has seen 130 million names erased.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/01/india-opposition-protest-rally-delhi\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
